                                "sense_id": "1633c2f1-345e-3669-ae5d-c2ebd9166e44",
                                "text": "Even the discoveries, in the past several decades, that cats carry a parasite that could contribute to schizophrenia, and that outdoor cats wreak ecological disaster, haven’t budged a curiously imbalanced relationship with this furry companion—or maybe cohabitant is more accurate."
